❌ `features/medication/` (domain slice — 사용 금지)

## import 예시

```typescript
// pages → widgets + features + entities
import { useHomeMedicationQueries } from '@/entities/medication/model/queries';
import { useDailyMedicationCheckMutations } from '@/features/daily-medication-check';
import { MedicationCalendarPanel } from '@/widgets/medication-calendar-panel';

// features → entities
import { toggleTaken } from '@/entities/medication/api/toggle-taken';

// entities api → shared api
import { supabase } from '@/shared/api/client';
```

## cross-entity invalidation

entity 간 쿼리 무효화는 `shared/lib/query-invalidation.ts`에 둔다.

## 금지

- `src/app/` 생성 (Expo Router 라우트 충돌 — FSD app은 `src/providers/`)
- `shared/`에 MedRow, Medication 타입 등 비즈니스 코드
- `pages/`에서 `@/entities/*/api` 직접 호출 (features mutation 또는 entity query 경유)
- `features/`에서 `@/shared/api/client` 직접 사용
- domain 단위 `features/<domain>/` slice 신규 추가
